{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Lucy hops on the bar. She drags a small chain with a few crystal attatched. She looks to bo with a sad face. \"There there luv... I'll figure something out.\" he says to Lucy. He looks back to Eliot. \"It's none yer fault... You tried to stop the fight.\" He sighs.","created_at":"2021-08-22T06:31:16.321000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878889040907231242","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"So did everyone else... and... maybe I made a bad choice... I didn't want anyone else getting hurt because of me... and... \"Eliot drifts into silence as he looks to the ground.","created_at":"2021-08-22T06:34:02.629000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878889738453545001","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"you tried to save us... I see that now...\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T06:36:15.166000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878890294354002012","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"I was the one trying to prolong the fight...\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T06:36:38.250000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878890391175319562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"If I hadn't been there... if I hadn't interfered things would have been different... maybe no one would've gotten hurt... it attacked Ms. Fuddles first sure.. but then it came for me... and it liked my food... maybe it wouldn't have attacked anyone... I just...\" Eliot sighs and takes a long drink of apple juice. \"We both did what we thought was best for everyone.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T06:40:37.478000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878891394570289172","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"And you had the better idea... I'm tired of all the fighting\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T06:41:44.829000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878891677060853761","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Me too... I fought a lot as a kid... I fought and just wanted things to be peaceful... even now I shut out most of the world outside my cafe... I don't want to fight... I don't even want to think about fighting..\" Eliot sighs.","created_at":"2021-08-22T06:48:09.690000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878893291284873247","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"I just want to make friends.\" He sighs... \"When than *thing* attacked... And i saw my friends getting hurt.\" He pauses \"I had lost control.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T06:50:02.029000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878893762468806746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"I want everyone to be friends too. And... tried to make friends with the thing that tried to kill me... or rather almost did... I didn't know most of the people that were there maybe if I did I would have tried to protect them more...\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T06:53:00.775000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878894512183836673","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
